  "description": "OQACUI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H84 Dy6 N10 O32,4.8(C3 H6 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.504-3.962 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.00-112.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L^{p-OMe})4(OH)4(NO3)2(H2O)2]·(H2O)0.5·(CH3COCH3)2.33. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 0 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
